{"id":"ac1dcd0c905db534","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-lem-konig.md","title":"König's Lemma","display":"lem-konig — König's Lemma","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-lem-konig","aliases":["58-lem-konig"],"display":"lem-konig — König's Lemma","depends_on":["[[../batch16/58-df-omega.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-finite-sequence.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-fun-branch-through-tree.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-lem-konig"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-lem-konig</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-konig — König's Lemma"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5045d216c83e75cb\" href=\"?note=5045d216c83e75cb\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-omega.md\">../batch16/58-df-omega.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f4bf86f66c1444da\" href=\"?note=f4bf86f66c1444da\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-finite-sequence.md\">../batch02/58-df-finite-sequence.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4c8fda037173bed0\" href=\"?note=4c8fda037173bed0\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-zfc-fun-branch-through-tree.md\">../batch15/58-df-zfc-fun-branch-through-tree.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,T,b\\in V\">\\(X,T,b\\in V\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq X^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(T\\subseteq X^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 对有限序列的初段封闭</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcFunBranchThroughTree}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcFunBranchThroughTree}_S\\)</span>（序列树分支谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4c8fda037173bed0\" href=\"?note=4c8fda037173bed0\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-zfc-fun-branch-through-tree.md\">../batch15/58-df-zfc-fun-branch-through-tree.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>（首个无限序数，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5045d216c83e75cb\" href=\"?note=5045d216c83e75cb\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-omega.md\">../batch16/58-df-omega.md</a>）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}konig}\\vdash\nT\\subseteq X^{&lt;\\omega}\n\\land\\forall t\\in T\\;\\forall m\\in\\operatorname{dom}(t)+1\\;(t{\\upharpoonright}m\\in T)\n\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(0&lt;|T\\cap X^n|&lt;\\omega\\bigr)\n\\to\\exists b\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcFunBranchThroughTree}_S(b,T)\\land\\operatorname{dom}(b)=\\omega\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}konig}\\vdash\nT\\subseteq X^{&lt;\\omega}\n\\land\\forall t\\in T\\;\\forall m\\in\\operatorname{dom}(t)+1\\;(t{\\upharpoonright}m\\in T)\n\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(0&lt;|T\\cap X^n|&lt;\\omega\\bigr)\n\\to\\exists b\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcFunBranchThroughTree}_S(b,T)\\land\\operatorname{dom}(b)=\\omega\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>这是 König 引理的有限非空层形式：每一层有限且非空的有限序列树有一条长度 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> 的分支。</li>\n<li>有限序列类型与显式初段闭包已经给出这里所需的序列树结构；不再把类关系符号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\subseteq\">\\(\\subseteq\\)</span> 当作集合值关系参数传给一般树谓词。</li>\n<li>通用偏序树谓词本身不推出序列初段封闭；该条件必须显式保留，否则可取每层一个但彼此不相容的节点作为反例。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch16/58-df-omega.md","status":"resolved","id":"5045d216c83e75cb","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-omega.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-finite-sequence.md","status":"resolved","id":"f4bf86f66c1444da","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-finite-sequence.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-zfc-fun-branch-through-tree.md","status":"resolved","id":"4c8fda037173bed0","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-fun-branch-through-tree.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-zfc-fun-branch-through-tree.md","status":"resolved","id":"4c8fda037173bed0","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcFunBranchThroughTree}_S$（序列树分支谓词，见 [[../batch15/58-df-zfc-fun-branch-through-tree.md]]）","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-omega.md","status":"resolved","id":"5045d216c83e75cb","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\omega$（首个无限序数，见 [[../batch16/58-df-omega.md]]）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,T,b\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"T\\subseteq X^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcFunBranchThroughTree}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}konig}\\vdash\nT\\subseteq X^{<\\omega}\n\\land\\forall t\\in T\\;\\forall m\\in\\operatorname{dom}(t)+1\\;(t{\\upharpoonright}m\\in T)\n\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(0<|T\\cap X^n|<\\omega\\bigr)\n\\to\\exists b\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcFunBranchThroughTree}_S(b,T)\\land\\operatorname{dom}(b)=\\omega\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\subseteq","display":false}],"bytes":1433,"backlinks":[{"id":"10f4d24c90baf620","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"它与 [[58-lem-konig]] 的“每层有限非空”形式等价，但前提包装方式不同。"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3911","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-lem-konig.md|58-lem-konig]]（batch17）"}],"outgoing":["5045d216c83e75cb","f4bf86f66c1444da","4c8fda037173bed0"]}